  "title": "Mind-like qualities belong to states and events, not particles",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "88716144-3ed1-4708-abff-96ef339315b6",
      "text": "Panpsychism usually attributes mind-like qualities to elementary particles such as quarks and photons, which quantum physics shows to be misguided. Its basic concepts are systems in states producing events, and these are what carry the phenomenal aspect.",
